# Keep the code graph about Sanad.
# These directories are the Claude harness installer payload, unpacked here
# on the way to ~/.claude. Indexing them took the graph from 783 nodes to
# 5,637, burying Sanad's own code under sample HTML and vendor scripts.
# Mirrored in .gitignore and pyproject [tool.ruff] extend-exclude.
agents/
commands/
hooks/
rules/
rules-scoped/
skills/
lessons/
evals/
history/
